# Data & auth

`auth.users` is identity. `public.accounts` is the app user. `public.profiles` is a public listing — not the same thing.

Roles live in `public.accounts.role` and `auth.users.raw_app_meta_data`. Never authorize from `user_metadata`.

Enable RLS on every exposed table. Put `SECURITY DEFINER` functions in `private`, not `public`. Views use `security_invoker = true`.

Media starts unpublished. Only `approved` media is visible to non-owners, via signed URLs.

Money path is payment → transaction → immutable ledger → receipt. No direct wallet updates.

Index foreign keys. Use cursor pagination. Prefer partial indexes for live profiles and pending moderation.
